由 Codex 接续补做 agent-adaptor PR #30 的真实影子验证修复（审查标识：便便）。

MC-006: recognize captured formal tint logs without weakening run identity or cleanup assertions. MC-007: observe typed active provider coordinates through the authoritative SDK lifecycle rather than expecting provider metadata on core RunStarted; close readiness at turn and execution termination. Cover the real public SDK app-server pipeline and retain failed run01 evidence.
